						],
						"pointId": 5739
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 741180601,
					"content": "...Thank you, Garde Menthe. That scoundrel left as soon as he caught sight of you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Garcia"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180602,
					"content": "I was merely doing my job.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Menthe"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180603,
					"content": "Sir, it appears we must vacate this city quickly, and return to Petrichor with all due haste.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lutong"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180604,
					"content": "I believe they're gradually losing their patience and may... resort to drastic measures.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lutong"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180605,
					"content": "I shall escalate this matter to my superiors. You should have a response within a few days.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Menthe"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180606,
					"content": "Ideally, we'll be able to assign a few officers to escort you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Menthe"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180607,
					"content": "Unfortunately, however, our resources are limited and we have affairs to take care of within the city. So we'll only be able to escort you part of the route, not all the way to Petrichor...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Menthe"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180608,
					"content": "Also, you should find somewhere safe to stay before you leave. Discussing this matter... may take some time.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180609,
						741180610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Menthe"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180609,
					"content": "Leave the escorting to me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180611
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741180611,
					"content": "Thank you. With you by our side, they won't dare do anything too rash.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lutong"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180612,
					"content": "But doesn't Kaia work with the troupe? If you guys go to Petrichor, then what about her?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180613
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180613,
					"content": "I shall go with them.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kaia"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180614,
					"content": "What!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Garcia"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180615,
					"content": "Miss, I mean this sincerely, from the bottom of my heart. Please, don't...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lutong"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180616,
					"content": "My dear Lutong, don't even bother. I'm just like your boss, you know — I simply can't be persuaded.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180617
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kaia"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180617,
					"content": "B—But we have no idea what kind of dangers we may encounter...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180618
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Garcia"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180618,
					"content": "All the more reason for me to come with you! Or are you intending to abandon me again like last time, left holding nothing but a composition with neither beginning nor end?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180619
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kaia"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180619,
					"content": "Moreover, our troupe director is quite curious about your machine-generated music...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180620
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kaia"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180620,
					"content": "I'm sure he'd be in favor of my coming along. Very well then, I've said my piece. Where shall we go next?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180621
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kaia"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180621,
					"content": "J—Just like in Sumeru, Kaia completely steamrolled Garcia...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180622
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180622,
					"content": "Garcia doesn't stand a chance against her...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180623
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741180623,
					"content": "Perhaps it's because Mr. Garcia doesn't even want to win...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180624
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lutong"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180624,
					"content": "*cough* Lutong! Let us hurry, we must find a suitable place to stay! Preferably somewhere with lots of people.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180625
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Garcia"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180625,
					"content": "Somewhere with lots of people... Perhaps we could try...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180626
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lutong"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180626,
					"content": "The hotel where our troupe is staying? It's quite busy, and we all know each other.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180627
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kaia"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180627,
					"content": "If any strangers try to sneak into our midst, they'll be discovered immediately. Also, our troupe director will certainly want to learn more about your Numbering Machine.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180628
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kaia"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180628,
					"content": "Uh...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180629
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Garcia"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180629,
					"content": "Then it's settled! Excellent, all of our problems have been solved.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180630
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lutong"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180630,
					"content": "All of our problems!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180631
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Garcia"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180631,
					"content": "#That's that then. {NICKNAME}, please take this. Consider it an advance deposit for your services.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180632
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lutong"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180632,
					"content": "I don't know when we'll be able to set off... but when the time comes, I'm counting on you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180633
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lutong"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180633,
					"content": "But... Why do I feel like we have even more problems than before!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Garcia"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180610,
					"content": "I can protect them.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180611
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
